{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"node-030","type":"group","x":1830,"y":730,"width":900,"height":560,"label":"本輪新增／測試的機制（2026-07-29）"},
		{"id":"node-002","type":"group","x":-70,"y":-100,"width":480,"height":1440,"label":"初始化來源（依優先序退回：Dirichlet → ML → Random，非各自獨立選一）"},
		{"id":"node-003","type":"text","text":"**Random init**\n（三者都關閉/失敗時的\n最終備援）\n\n`ELECTRO_DIRICHLET_INIT=0`\n且 `ELECTRO_ML_INIT=0`\n才會真的用到","x":0,"y":-40,"width":380,"height":360,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-004","type":"text","text":"**Dirichlet 調和延拓初始化**\n（生產預設，取代舊版 Jacobi）\n\n`ELECTRO_DIRICHLET_INIT=1`\ngraph Laplacian 封閉解\n只開 boundary 訊號\n(bnd_weight=2.0，grp/mib=0)\n\n全 100 案 Neutral\n1.4018 → 1.3776 (-1.73%)","x":0,"y":360,"width":380,"height":480,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-032","type":"text","text":"**`ELECTRO_MIB_PORTFOLIO=1`**\n\nMIB 統一版當額外候選\n（非無條件套用）\n小幅正貢獻","x":2300,"y":830,"width":400,"height":190,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-033","type":"text","text":"**已測不採用**：`SLICE_WALLS=0`（小贏但不穩健）、`SLICE_BUDGET=1200`（被兩端支配）、`_cut_options` 面積提早否決（等價但只有 1.01×）","x":1860,"y":1090,"width":840,"height":130,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-040","type":"text","text":"**Proxy Cost 排名**\n\n`exp(2·V_rel)·(hpwl/ha + area/aa)`\n錨點跟候選池無關\n（aa = 總面積/0.966）","x":1230,"y":820,"width":380,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node-005","type":"text","text":"**ML 暖啟動**\n（`ELECTRO_ML_INIT=1`，生產預設\nDirichlet 停用/失敗時的退回）\n\n只在 `seeds>1` 才使用\nTransformer 預測\n每個方塊的中心點","x":0,"y":880,"width":380,"height":360,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-011","type":"text","text":"## Stage 2a\n**legalize()**（梯度式）\n\n順序抽取 → 壓實 → `_cleanup` 保底\n\n⚡ `ELECTRO_FAST_CLEANUP=1`\n增量式重掃，只檢查動過的方塊\n**legalize 2.4× 加速**","x":1230,"y":-50,"width":380,"height":350,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-012","type":"text","text":"## Stage 3\n**soft_repair()**\n\nboundary snap\n+ wide-swap（預設開）\n\ngrouping\npush-past（預設開）","x":1830,"y":-35,"width":380,"height":310,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-031","type":"text","text":"⚡ **`ELECTRO_FAST_CLEANUP=1`**\n（本輪最大勝利）\n\n增量式 `_cleanup`\n**真實 Total −12.2%**\n快過中位數 43 → 95 案\n**品質逐位元不變**","x":1860,"y":810,"width":400,"height":230,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-050","type":"text","text":"## Portfolio 選擇\n\n每個候選都算一次 proxy cost，**逐案挑最低者送出**\n——不是調出單一最佳參數，是同時養一群候選","x":1175,"y":1440,"width":490,"height":170,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-020","type":"text","text":"**place-compact**（`ELECTRO_PLACE_COMPACT=1`）\n\n把已壓實佈局的中心點當新初始化，再跑一輪短版 analytical_place → 額外候選\n`PLACE_COMPACT_TOPK=3`：只對 prerank 前 3 名重拍，砍 75% 計算量","x":1100,"y":440,"width":760,"height":180,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node-001","type":"text","text":"# Electro Pipeline 架構圖\n\n**目前主力：`collaborate/electro_v19/`**（凍結基準）+ `electro_v20/`（逐位元相同副本，供 opt-in 實驗，如對偶上升/ADMM）\n生產預設全 100 案 Neutral=1.3776、100/100 合法、99/100 快過中位數。\n完整方塊說明見同資料夾 `Electronic_Pipeline.md`。","x":-70,"y":-440,"width":820,"height":170,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-010","type":"text","text":"## Stage 1\n**analytical_place()**\n\nAdam 梯度下降\n`ELECTRO_ITERS=300`\n（600→300 品質幾乎無損）\n\n+ MIB_ANCHOR_SNAP（生產預設，訓練中引導）\n+ MIB_ANCHOR（生產預設，輸出前形狀 snap）\n混合群組軟成員形狀對齊錨點\nVmib 從舊版 94-99 壓到 ~50","x":630,"y":-10,"width":380,"height":480,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-060","type":"text","x":630,"y":510,"width":380,"height":480,"color":"2","text":"## Stage 2b\n**slice_pack()**（切割式）\n\n面積比例遞迴 guillotine 切割\n軟方塊長寬比自由 → 填充率可近 100%\n\n**貢獻 −25.7%，是主力機制**\n（Otten 1982 切割式佈局）\n\n+ SLICE_ALIGN_PORTFOLIO（生產預設）\n兩種切割方向都保留成候選\n不是只留一種，交給後面排名挑"},
		{"id":"node-021","type":"text","x":1900,"y":350,"width":760,"height":280,"color":"2","text":"**LP 位移最小化候選**\n（`ELECTRO_LP_DISPLACEMENT_PORTFOLIO=1`，生產預設）\n\n對排名前段的種子候選，額外跑一次\nLP 式最小位移 legalize（`lp_legalize.py`）\n產生獨立候選丟進同一個池，嚴格加法式\n（失敗就什麼都不做，不會比原本差）\n\n沿用前身「v14 LP all sizes/4 seeds」\n已知最佳可重現全 100 案配置"},
		{"id":"node-070","type":"group","x":1830,"y":1330,"width":1030,"height":1210,"label":"研究方向紀錄（2026-08-03～08-04）：3 個負面結果 + 1 個驗證正面但未預設"},
		{"id":"node-071","type":"text","x":1860,"y":1430,"width":460,"height":510,"color":"1","text":"**L-BFGS 打磨階段**（負面）\n\n`frac>=0.7` 時凍結所有 schedule\n權重、Adam 切換到 L-BFGS 收尾\n\n3 組切換點全部**更慢**（3.35-6.54×）\n且品質更差。`ELECTRO_LBFGS`\n預設維持關閉，不進生產"},
		{"id":"node-072","type":"text","x":2360,"y":1430,"width":460,"height":510,"color":"1","text":"**Per-RMAP 可行性追尋**（負面）\n\n拿現有 repair 函式當投影運算子，\n加擾動＋重設的交替投影外迴圈\n\n20 案平均 V_rel **變差 28.2%**\n（且慢 33 倍），15 輪上限內\n全部沒收斂到零違規。獨立標準腳本，\n未整合進生產管線"},
		{"id":"node-073","type":"text","x":1860,"y":1980,"width":460,"height":510,"color":"1","text":"**ADMM 邊界一致性**（負面）\n\n把 `lam_bnd*bnd` 換成有號殘差的\n增廣拉格朗日二次拉力（`electro_v21/`）\n\n20 案：Neutral **變差 +8.1%**，\nVgrp/Vmib/Vbnd **全部變差**\n（連沒被動到的 grp/mib 都變差——\n本 session 反覆驗證的「共用梯度\n預算耦合」再次出現）。`ELECTRO_ADMM_BND`\n預設維持關閉"},
		{"id":"node-074","type":"text","x":2360,"y":1980,"width":460,"height":510,"color":"4","text":"**對照：對偶上升 boundary**（驗證正面，尚未預設）\n\n`ELECTRO_DUAL_ASCENT_BND=1 ELECTRO_DA_K=40`\n同一個 bnd loss 槽位，跟 ADMM 互斥\n\n全 100 案 Neutral 1.3776→**1.3691**\n（-0.62%），Vbnd 174→**140**，\n跑得還更快（2.044s→1.84s/案）\n尚未寫進 `electro_optimizer.py` 的\n`setdefault`——目前最強已知配置，\n但要手動加旗標才能重現"}
	],
